cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "liftmath"
abstract: >-
  A simple gym calculator: estimate a one-rep max from a weight x reps set,
  work out which plates to load for a target barbell weight, and score
  relative strength across bodyweights with Wilks (original + 2020), DOTS,
  and IPF GL points. Pure Python standard library, no runtime dependencies.
authors:
